                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9b12f5a-c6e6-344e-9f5b-11b8dc7783fa",
                        "entry_id": "92ef6260-f4d6-3f48-81cd-3a445cdd6c82",
                        "glosses": [
                            "since long ago"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "795efaa5-988b-4e4f-a485-af9dd0a30a55",
                                "sense_id": "f9b12f5a-c6e6-344e-9f5b-11b8dc7783fa",
                                "text": "Спе́реди находи́лся палиса́дник, а сза́ди сад; а в саду́ — что клету́шек, пу́шек, амба́рчиков, погребко́в, ледничко́в… — как есть гнездо́! И не то что́бы во всех э́тих помеще́ниях сохраня́лось мно́го добра́ — ины́е уже́ и завали́лись; да заведено́ всё э́то бы́ло и́сстари — ну, и держа́лось.",
                                "translation": "In front was a little palisade, and behind a garden, and in the garden outbuildings of every sort, granaries, cellars, ice-houses . . . a perfect nest of them! And it was not that there were many goods stored in all these outhouses; some, indeed, were tumbling down; but it had all been so arranged in old days, and so it had remained.",
                                "english": "In front was a little palisade, and behind a garden, and in the garden outbuildings of every sort, granaries, cellars, ice-houses . . . a perfect nest of them! And it was not that there were many goods stored in all these outhouses; some, indeed, were tumbling down; but it had all been so arranged in old days, and so it had remained."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d512649-f919-4cbe-a4df-67cdc32d131a",
                                "sense_id": "f9b12f5a-c6e6-344e-9f5b-11b8dc7783fa",
                                "text": "Вя́леная и копчё́ная (ку́рская) во́бла и тара́нь — и́сстари изве́стный, дешё́вый и популя́рный ры́бный това́р."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
